  "shared_notes": [
    "Note. Held-out evaluation of the LightGBM model using a participant-level train/validation/test split (early stopping on the validation partition). The model had no out-of-sample predictive skill; all machine-learning outputs, including scenario contrasts (Supplementary Tables S13, S14 and S17; Supplementary Fig. S5), are descriptive model outputs. Abbreviations: EVI, enhanced vegetation index; LightGBM, light gradient boosting machine; MAE, mean absolute error; O₃, ozone; RMSE, root mean squared error; SHAP, Shapley additive explanations."
